{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p080a","title":"曹真等讨破治元多与卢水胡封赏","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p080a-account","label":"裴注·魏书","text":"曹真等讨破治元多与卢水胡封赏","evidence":["wendi-e-p080a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0038","role":"征讨","evidence":["wendi-e-p080a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0122","role":"被讨","evidence":["wendi-e-p080a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0123","role":"被讨","evidence":["wendi-e-p080a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"黄初二年十一月辛未","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o019","basis":"黄初二年十一月辛未"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p080a-q","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p080a-q","source_order":[2,281,"P080a"],"related_events":[{"event":"liusima-e2-wei015-071","type":"related","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","wendi-e-p080a-q"]}],"order":593}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0123","name":"封赏","evidence":["wendi-q-p080"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-p080-wendi-p0123","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p080"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既夜藏精卒三千人为伏，使参军成公英，督千余骑挑战，敕使佯退。胡果争奔之，因发伏，截其后；首尾进击，大破之，斩首获生以万数","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":143,"end":203},{"id":"liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"贼七千余骑。逆拒军于鹯阴口〖6〗。既扬声军由鹯阴〖7〗，乃潜由（且）〔揟〕次出至武威〖8〗。胡以为神，引还显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":72,"end":127},{"id":"liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-09fc0acef808d7824108","layer":"original","quote":"帝甚悦，诏曰：“卿逾河历险，以劳击逸，以寡胜众；功过南仲〖10〗，勤逾吉甫〖11〗。此勋非但破胡，乃永宁河右：使吾长无西顾之念矣！”徙封西乡侯，增邑二百；并前四百户","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"帝忧之，曰：“非既莫能安凉州。”乃召邹岐，以既代之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":49},{"id":"liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"诏曰：“昔贾复请击郾贼〖3〗，光武笑曰：‘执金吾击郾，吾复何忧？’卿谋略过人，今则其时。以便宜从事，勿复先请","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":50,"end":104},{"id":"liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"既至金城，欲渡河，诸将、守以为：“兵少道险，未可深入。”既曰：“道虽险，非井陉之隘；夷狄乌合，无左车之计〖5〗。今武威危急，赴之宜速！”遂渡河","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71},{"id":"liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等，继其后","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":109,"end":125},{"id":"liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"胡骑数千，因大风欲放火烧营，将士皆恐","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":124,"end":142},{"id":"liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"凉州卢水胡伊健妓妾、治元多等反〖2〗，河西大扰","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23},{"id":"liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既已据武威，曜乃至，儒等犹未达。既劳赐将士，欲进军击胡。诸将皆曰：“士卒疲倦，虏众气锐，难与争锋。”既曰：“今军无现粮，当因敌为资。若虏见兵合，退依深山；追之则道险穷饿，兵还则出候寇抄。如此，兵不得解，所谓‘一日纵敌，患在数世’也。”遂前，军显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123},{"id":"wendi-e-p080a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f526d1a1f2ac1dd03e36","layer":"pei","quote":"十一月辛未，镇西将军曹真命众将及州郡兵，讨破叛胡治元多、卢水封赏等。斩首五万余级，获生口十万，羊一百一十一万口，牛八万，河西遂平。","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dea0b21111fc3c1b95dd","start":10,"end":75},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183},{"id":"wendi-q-p080","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f526d1a1f2ac1dd03e36","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“十一月辛未，镇西将军曹真命众将及州郡兵，讨破叛胡治元多、卢水封赏等。斩首五万余级，获生口十万，羊一百一十一万口，牛八万，河西遂平。帝初闻胡决水灌显美，谓左右诸将曰：‘昔隗嚣灌略阳，而光武因其疲弊，进兵灭之。今胡决水灌显美，其事正相似。破胡事，今至不久。’旬日，破胡告檄到，上大笑曰：‘吾策之于帷幕之内，诸将奋击于万里之外，其相应若合符节。前后战克获虏，未有如此也！’”","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dea0b21111fc3c1b95dd","start":0,"end":194}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
